  m_text: "Alt fire to shoot a <color=#FF4343>magnet</color> that pulls all nearby <color=#FF4343>nails</color> towards it. \r\n\r\nMagnets stick to <color=#FF4343>surfaces</color> and <color=#FF4343>enemies</color> and can be broken with <color=#FF4343>hitscan</color> weapons.\r"
